# Scenario 'state_full': builds the "everything full" cartridge for the searches of round 3. Starts from 'mail_receive_many' (12 mails in the mailbox); for eight mails in a row it opens
# the mail (list -> A -> icon bar -> A), presses SELECT on the sender page and saves the sender in the slot list of the address book: the six slots fill up, the seventh and eighth
# attempts meet used slots ("メールアドレスを うわがきします よろしいですか?", いいえ is the default). Ends in the mailbox list. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x2
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot list
